      "description": "[The Distrubuted Renewable Energy (DRE) Atlas](https://dre.energydata.info) is an open-access, publicly accessible, web-based, and interactive platform providing detailed information on settlements across 58 countries. This platform enables users to easily navigate and obtain essential information about potential mini-grid sites, facilitating informed investment decisions. Its analytics capabilities allow decision-makers to identify key market indicators for investment planning.",
